(906773, 105020, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun and almost goofy. A good place to be. 9</td>', 'Fun and almost goofy. A good place to be. 9', '2004-09-13 01:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(906774, 104996, 19708, '<td valign="top">This shot tells a story. The soft focus on the cowboy walking away, makes it suggestive, and affects an emotional area in the viewer.<br/>Few images can be given to a group of students and have them formulate a story from it. This is one of those rare gems. (I can aslo see this on a Stetson Cologne ad.)<br/>This is superb photography! ((10))<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-09-21 03:14:09.</i></td>', 'This shot tells a story. The soft focus on the cowboy walking away, makes it suggestive, and affects an emotional area in the viewer.Few images can be given to a group of students and have them formulate a story from it. This is one of those rare gems. (I can aslo see this on a Stetson Cologne ad.)This is superb photography! ((10))', '2004-09-13 01:21:25.000000', '2004-09-21 04:14:09.000000', 1),
(906779, 105066, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good idea and quite a fancy mirror. The background foliage seems in to be focus and the rocks at the bottom are out of focus. Because of the candle/vase my eyes are going down there and the OOF is a little distracting. Changing the focus point or else using a smaller aperature to get the entire scene in focus may have helped some.</td>', 'Good idea and quite a fancy mirror. The background foliage seems in to be focus and the rocks at the bottom are out of focus. Because of the candle/vase my eyes are going down there and the OOF is a little distracting. Changing the focus point or else using a smaller aperature to get the entire scene in focus may have helped some.', '2004-09-13 01:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(906784, 105046, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun geometry and lines. Contrasty tones work well. 9</td>', 'Fun geometry and lines. Contrasty tones work well. 9', '2004-09-13 01:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(906795, 104996, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice bit of storytelling here. Sepia works well for this one. 9</td>', 'Nice bit of storytelling here. Sepia works well for this one. 9', '2004-09-13 01:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(906803, 105032, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very edgy, artsy photo. I really enjoy looking at it. Nice tones and colors. 9</td>', 'Very edgy, artsy photo. I really enjoy looking at it. Nice tones and colors. 9', '2004-09-13 01:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(906806, 105025, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun idea! I like the composition, and the selective color looks good here.</td>', 'Fun idea! I like the composition, and the selective color looks good here.', '2004-09-13 01:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(906813, 104342, 10414, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model.  Your choice for b&amp;w works well here.  Constructive critizism....I would have maybe cropped about an inch off the bottom of the picture...right to the bottom part of the mirror. Her leg in the lower right hand corner is a bit of a distraction..BUT....I''m still giving you a 9 because I LOVE this shot! :)</td>', 'Beautiful model.  Your choice for b&w works well here.  Constructive critizism....I would have maybe cropped about an inch off the bottom of the picture...right to the bottom part of the mirror. Her leg in the lower right hand corner is a bit of a distraction..BUT....I''m still giving you a 9 because I LOVE this shot! :)', '2004-09-13 01:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
