(907478, 104320, 25183, '<td valign="top">This took some plotting and planning, and other than the look up the nostrils, it is interesting!  It''s just my personal pet peeve though, to line up a shot so we are not looking up anyone''s nose!  Sorry, I still give this a 9</td>', 'This took some plotting and planning, and other than the look up the nostrils, it is interesting!  It''s just my personal pet peeve though, to line up a shot so we are not looking up anyone''s nose!  Sorry, I still give this a 9', '2004-09-13 10:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(907479, 104869, 25483, '<td valign="top">The over abundance of grain has ruined what could have been a fine photograph.  It appears that you have a Canon DSLR, which shouldnt allow for such grain even at high ISO.  Try taking the shot again and adjust some of the settings (ie ISO 200,  1/10 shutter speed, tripod to stabilize camera, etc)  Also try using a flash, it will black out the entire mirror except for the reflection.<br/> <br/>Good luck in your next challenge <br/></td>', 'The over abundance of grain has ruined what could have been a fine photograph.  It appears that you have a Canon DSLR, which shouldnt allow for such grain even at high ISO.  Try taking the shot again and adjust some of the settings (ie ISO 200,  1/10 shutter speed, tripod to stabilize camera, etc)  Also try using a flash, it will black out the entire mirror except for the reflection. Good luck in your next challenge ', '2004-09-13 10:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(907480, 104110, 25143, '<td valign="top">very nice sense of humour and overall image</td>', 'very nice sense of humour and overall image', '2004-09-13 10:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(907481, 104790, 25183, '<td valign="top">Very nice, it appears to be the cat walking on the fence and reflecting in the bird bath.  A unique perspective, but I am one that thinks it sould have had a physical mirror since it did say THE MIRROR should be evident.  I enjoyed this attempt and unique look.  7</td>', 'Very nice, it appears to be the cat walking on the fence and reflecting in the bird bath.  A unique perspective, but I am one that thinks it sould have had a physical mirror since it did say THE MIRROR should be evident.  I enjoyed this attempt and unique look.  7', '2004-09-13 10:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(907487, 105095, 4226, '<td valign="top">Very clever composition. full marks to you for creativity. At least in this challenge I was looking for more creative shots than just a person or object standing in front of a mirror. <br/>The only critique I have is that the top part  could have been more in focus. Not sure how you got this so may be it wasn''t possible. But anyways very well done and I am hoping you explain the details of how you got this<br/></td>', 'Very clever composition. full marks to you for creativity. At least in this challenge I was looking for more creative shots than just a person or object standing in front of a mirror. The only critique I have is that the top part  could have been more in focus. Not sure how you got this so may be it wasn''t possible. But anyways very well done and I am hoping you explain the details of how you got this', '2004-09-13 10:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
