(907490, 104416, 4226, '<td valign="top">IMO, the camera shouldn''t be a part of any good composition. No hard feelings, but I tend to mark  the photos down for that. In your case I like the fact that its better than some photographs, as atleast you have tried to ues more than one mirror and tried multiple reflections.  a 5.0</td>', 'IMO, the camera shouldn''t be a part of any good composition. No hard feelings, but I tend to mark  the photos down for that. In your case I like the fact that its better than some photographs, as atleast you have tried to ues more than one mirror and tried multiple reflections.  a 5.0', '2004-09-13 11:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
