(907668, 105038, 23956, '<td valign="top">Very well done, great idea! This would be perhaps a bit better if the mirror were lowered so that you could crop down more from the top without losing the frame.</td>', 'Very well done, great idea! This would be perhaps a bit better if the mirror were lowered so that you could crop down more from the top without losing the frame.', '2004-09-13 13:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(907671, 105061, 6532, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit out of focus.  I do like the colors (white and pink)</td>', 'Seems a bit out of focus.  I do like the colors (white and pink)', '2004-09-13 13:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(907673, 104239, 23956, '<td valign="top">Cute image, but it is disconcerting the way the young bear looks like he is about to pitch sideways into oblivion. It would also be better without the tags on the toys.</td>', 'Cute image, but it is disconcerting the way the young bear looks like he is about to pitch sideways into oblivion. It would also be better without the tags on the toys.', '2004-09-13 13:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(907675, 104831, 14603, '<td valign="top">I like the use of selective desat in this as it definitely works for this kind of image.<br/>I have a few similar shots in my portfolio where I used pools of water with the same effect.<br/>Hope this does well....9</td>', 'I like the use of selective desat in this as it definitely works for this kind of image.I have a few similar shots in my portfolio where I used pools of water with the same effect.Hope this does well....9', '2004-09-13 13:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(907677, 104939, 23956, '<td valign="top">Great composition, I really like this!</td>', 'Great composition, I really like this!', '2004-09-13 13:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(907685, 104996, 23956, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but I think it''s cropped too tightly. We should be able to see all the way around at least one side of the mirror, as well as the top and the bottom.</td>', 'Great shot, but I think it''s cropped too tightly. We should be able to see all the way around at least one side of the mirror, as well as the top and the bottom.', '2004-09-13 13:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(907690, 105023, 23956, '<td valign="top">The strange angles of your ''verticals'' on the dresserfront and the headboard/footboard are disconcerting. Great lighting, though.</td>', 'The strange angles of your ''verticals'' on the dresserfront and the headboard/footboard are disconcerting. Great lighting, though.', '2004-09-13 13:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(907703, 104721, 14603, '<td valign="top">Why can`t I find buildings like this in Scotland...it`s so unfair  :)<br/>Works very well for the challenge..I especially like the way the light gradually increases as you scan up the image.<br/>Very nicely done.<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'Why can`t I find buildings like this in Scotland...it`s so unfair  :)Works very well for the challenge..I especially like the way the light gradually increases as you scan up the image.Very nicely done.Good luck.', '2004-09-13 13:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(907706, 104970, 24715, '<td valign="top">Nice pic. Too bad the other cars and parking lot are visible..</td>', 'Nice pic. Too bad the other cars and parking lot are visible..', '2004-09-13 13:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(907707, 104890, 26482, '<td valign="top">Scary!</td>', 'Scary!', '2004-09-13 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(907708, 105144, 24715, '<td valign="top">I had exactly same idea. Great!</td>', 'I had exactly same idea. Great!', '2004-09-13 13:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(907711, 104967, 17485, '<td valign="top">S2K Gathering?  Love it!</td>', 'S2K Gathering?  Love it!', '2004-09-13 13:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(907714, 103925, 25754, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but much too dark. Would have been nice to see more of the person''s expression.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but much too dark. Would have been nice to see more of the person''s expression.', '2004-09-13 13:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(907722, 105095, 25754, '<td valign="top">Unique and well done!</td>', 'Unique and well done!', '2004-09-13 13:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(907732, 104978, 25754, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but does not meet the challenge criteria</td>', 'Nice photo, but does not meet the challenge criteria', '2004-09-13 13:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(907738, 104521, 25754, '<td valign="top">Well done. The light and composition is perfect, and I like the way the statue appears to be looking at its reflection.</td>', 'Well done. The light and composition is perfect, and I like the way the statue appears to be looking at its reflection.', '2004-09-13 14:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(907743, 105066, 25754, '<td valign="top">This is quite pretty. I think the vase is too distracting though. I would have cropped out the background a bit more as well.</td>', 'This is quite pretty. I think the vase is too distracting though. I would have cropped out the background a bit more as well.', '2004-09-13 14:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(907785, 105038, 23614, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea!</td>', 'Very nice idea!', '2004-09-13 14:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(907797, 105021, 23614, '<td valign="top">Very nice result, except for the flame reflexion cut off at the bottom.</td>', 'Very nice result, except for the flame reflexion cut off at the bottom.', '2004-09-13 14:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(907865, 104435, 17304, '<td valign="top">Your angle here leaves the feeling that the child is hanging upside down..or about to fall out of the picture. I like the photo..just leaves a strange feeling.</td>', 'Your angle here leaves the feeling that the child is hanging upside down..or about to fall out of the picture. I like the photo..just leaves a strange feeling.', '2004-09-13 15:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(907894, 105030, 24459, '<td valign="top">I would call it perfect if the hands were a bit more clear (in focus). Although I understand that would be quite hard to do. Anyway, a very nice photo.8</td>', 'I would call it perfect if the hands were a bit more clear (in focus). Although I understand that would be quite hard to do. Anyway, a very nice photo.8', '2004-09-13 16:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(907900, 104237, 24459, '<td valign="top">Out of focus. Bad composition. Gray colours. And the worst part is that there is nothing to look at in this picture.</td>', 'Out of focus. Bad composition. Gray colours. And the worst part is that there is nothing to look at in this picture.', '2004-09-13 16:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(907912, 104862, 24459, '<td valign="top">Simple comment: Would be much better if you unscrewed the stand from the wood-man butt. Don''t you agree?</td>', 'Simple comment: Would be much better if you unscrewed the stand from the wood-man butt. Don''t you agree?', '2004-09-13 16:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(907917, 104996, 16301, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea, I like the tone. I think the focus on the man could have been improved though :)</td>', 'Very nice idea, I like the tone. I think the focus on the man could have been improved though :)', '2004-09-13 16:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(907983, 105061, 18080, '<td valign="top">Great Image<br/>i think (and my opinion doesn''t count...) that it is slightly spoiled by the frame.<br/>Good luck though<br/>8</td>', 'Great Imagei think (and my opinion doesn''t count...) that it is slightly spoiled by the frame.Good luck though8', '2004-09-13 16:47:38.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(907988, 105027, 18080, '<td valign="top">10<br/>this could be an advert in a top magazine<br/>well done<br/>i love it<br/>hope this is a ribon.<br/>10</td>', '10this could be an advert in a top magazinewell donei love ithope this is a ribon.10', '2004-09-13 16:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(908003, 105108, 24435, '<td valign="top">very cute<br/></td>', 'very cute', '2004-09-13 17:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(908013, 104975, 10414, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture!  The expression on the little girl''s face is precious.  10+</td>', 'Beautiful capture!  The expression on the little girl''s face is precious.  10+', '2004-09-13 17:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(908016, 105136, 10414, '<td valign="top">Great shot! I love your choice of colors on the little girl One of my favorites!</td>', 'Great shot! I love your choice of colors on the little girl One of my favorites!', '2004-09-13 17:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(908019, 105075, 18028, '<td valign="top">beauty, erotic and emotinal.<br/>technically, the forehead was a bit over ex.</td>', 'beauty, erotic and emotinal.technically, the forehead was a bit over ex.', '2004-09-13 17:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(908020, 105057, 10414, '<td valign="top">I think this is my very favorite of them all!  The expression on the little girl''s face is just priceless!! Great job! 10 :)</td>', 'I think this is my very favorite of them all!  The expression on the little girl''s face is just priceless!! Great job! 10 :)', '2004-09-13 17:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(908021, 104890, 18028, '<td valign="top">My favorite for this challenge...very moody and very 50''s.</td>', 'My favorite for this challenge...very moody and very 50''s.', '2004-09-13 17:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(908024, 105027, 18028, '<td valign="top">mighty fine shot, and the color scheme is great.</td>', 'mighty fine shot, and the color scheme is great.', '2004-09-13 17:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(908026, 104252, 10414, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture!  The only thing I would have liked to have seen different, was a closer crop of the adorable little girl. Maybe crop off the top part of the mirror. I LOVE her pink bow! :)  9......10</td>', 'Beautiful picture!  The only thing I would have liked to have seen different, was a closer crop of the adorable little girl. Maybe crop off the top part of the mirror. I LOVE her pink bow! :)  9......10', '2004-09-13 17:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(908029, 104775, 18028, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2004-09-13 17:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(908031, 104676, 18028, '<td valign="top">very sexy shot</td>', 'very sexy shot', '2004-09-13 17:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(908033, 105065, 18028, '<td valign="top">very poor shot, nothing in there is even in focus, and there is lens flare.</td>', 'very poor shot, nothing in there is even in focus, and there is lens flare.', '2004-09-13 17:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(908034, 104951, 10414, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see this a little lighter...but it''s a great impact shot all the same.  I love pictures that tell a whole story by just looking at one picture. Great job! 9</td>', 'I would have liked to see this a little lighter...but it''s a great impact shot all the same.  I love pictures that tell a whole story by just looking at one picture. Great job! 9', '2004-09-13 17:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(908036, 104052, 18028, '<td valign="top">fairly un-inspired shot, no angle , no composition.</td>', 'fairly un-inspired shot, no angle , no composition.', '2004-09-13 17:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(908041, 103435, 18028, '<td valign="top">I just don''t get this shot...what mirrors? if the mirrors represent 1% of the image....how can they be considered as an important part of the shot?</td>', 'I just don''t get this shot...what mirrors? if the mirrors represent 1% of the image....how can they be considered as an important part of the shot?', '2004-09-13 17:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(908045, 105125, 18028, '<td valign="top">I just don''t get this shot, no focus point, no particular subject and the mirror itself is out of focus...so it''s hard to see it.</td>', 'I just don''t get this shot, no focus point, no particular subject and the mirror itself is out of focus...so it''s hard to see it.', '2004-09-13 17:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(908050, 104507, 24454, '<td valign="top">Great picture.   I love the colors, and the border you used is perfect to complement and bring out the color of the peach even more.</td>', 'Great picture.   I love the colors, and the border you used is perfect to complement and bring out the color of the peach even more.', '2004-09-13 17:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(908053, 103850, 9906, '<td valign="top">Looks like you have camera motion in this shot.  Were you hand held or using a tripod?  If you were using a tripod, you might not have had enough light to get the shutterspeed fast enough to isolate the motion of the water.  Nice attempt though.  Your mirror is not very evident.<br/>TC</td>', 'Looks like you have camera motion in this shot.  Were you hand held or using a tripod?  If you were using a tripod, you might not have had enough light to get the shutterspeed fast enough to isolate the motion of the water.  Nice attempt though.  Your mirror is not very evident.TC', '2004-09-13 17:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(908055, 104649, 9906, '<td valign="top">NIce sharpness in the center of the flower but the edges are a little soft.  I personally would like to see more DOF in a shot like this.  Also, your reflection is a little dark.  My recomendation (based on MY taste) would be more light and a smaller aperature.<br/>TC</td>', 'NIce sharpness in the center of the flower but the edges are a little soft.  I personally would like to see more DOF in a shot like this.  Also, your reflection is a little dark.  My recomendation (based on MY taste) would be more light and a smaller aperature.TC', '2004-09-13 17:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(908057, 104393, 9906, '<td valign="top">There''s a little much going on in this shot with all the conflicting lines.  My eye doesn''t know where to rest.  A tighter crop (more zoom) would simplify this.<br/>TC</td>', 'There''s a little much going on in this shot with all the conflicting lines.  My eye doesn''t know where to rest.  A tighter crop (more zoom) would simplify this.TC', '2004-09-13 17:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(908065, 104671, 9906, '<td valign="top">You set the lenses up behind the eye piece?  How did you get it to focus on them?  Interesting shot from a technical perspective.  Not all that attention grabbing though.  Would like to see how ya did it!<br/>TC</td>', 'You set the lenses up behind the eye piece?  How did you get it to focus on them?  Interesting shot from a technical perspective.  Not all that attention grabbing though.  Would like to see how ya did it!TC', '2004-09-13 17:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(908066, 105040, 9906, '<td valign="top">Why is there a biplane dive bombing your house?<br/>TC</td>', 'Why is there a biplane dive bombing your house?TC', '2004-09-13 17:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(908069, 104540, 24454, '<td valign="top">Great job on how crystal clear this is.  It''s a beautiful picture.</td>', 'Great job on how crystal clear this is.  It''s a beautiful picture.', '2004-09-13 17:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(908071, 104237, 9906, '<td valign="top">Technically meets the challenge, but isn''t very attention grabbing/holding.<br/>TC</td>', 'Technically meets the challenge, but isn''t very attention grabbing/holding.TC', '2004-09-13 17:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(908076, 104856, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice optical illusion.  Your a bit too contrasty for my taste though.  A little fill lighting from the dark side would help with the hot spots, bring down the contrast a touch and give it more depth.<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice optical illusion.  Your a bit too contrasty for my taste though.  A little fill lighting from the dark side would help with the hot spots, bring down the contrast a touch and give it more depth.TC', '2004-09-13 18:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(908082, 104975, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is perfect.  I had it in mind to do something like this too, but just got back from vacation and didn''t get a chance to do it.  You did it better even than I had it in my mind anyway.  This is my first unhesitant 10 :)</td>', 'This is perfect.  I had it in mind to do something like this too, but just got back from vacation and didn''t get a chance to do it.  You did it better even than I had it in my mind anyway.  This is my first unhesitant 10 :)', '2004-09-13 18:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(908084, 105136, 24454, '<td valign="top">Great Picture!</td>', 'Great Picture!', '2004-09-13 18:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(908113, 104860, 23338, '<td valign="top">Huh!  For a second, I thought I''d just seen this little guy in the challenge, "Backlighting".  He''s kinda cute anyway.    Wish his reflected image was sharper, that he was more "centered", and that his original (not reflected) shell was more in focus overall.  But, that''s just me.  Nice image.</td>', 'Huh!  For a second, I thought I''d just seen this little guy in the challenge, "Backlighting".  He''s kinda cute anyway.    Wish his reflected image was sharper, that he was more "centered", and that his original (not reflected) shell was more in focus overall.  But, that''s just me.  Nice image.', '2004-09-13 18:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(908121, 105131, 23338, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and pose in this image.  The color scheme and dramatic contrast of red against dark hair is very attractive also.  Nice image.  The facial mood does the title justice, too.</td>', 'I really like the composition and pose in this image.  The color scheme and dramatic contrast of red against dark hair is very attractive also.  Nice image.  The facial mood does the title justice, too.', '2004-09-13 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(908148, 105075, 9906, '<td valign="top">Love the compostion ya got workin'' here.  Not sure about the desat effect though.  You are very contrasty which makes your models colors seem unnatural.  If that is what you wanted you achieved it.  I don''t like it personally though...<br/>TC</td>', 'Love the compostion ya got workin'' here.  Not sure about the desat effect though.  You are very contrasty which makes your models colors seem unnatural.  If that is what you wanted you achieved it.  I don''t like it personally though...TC', '2004-09-13 18:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(908149, 105032, 23338, '<td valign="top">This image captures my attention and makes me study it for longer time spans than most images here.  What''s reflection and what''s not?  Why is there crystal clear focus on the edge of the sphere at the center and yet the people shown on that sphere are totally fuzzy?  Why is the woman to the left of the sphere being seen thru the straight lines?  It''s just very interesting.  And the color scheme and contrasts between darks and lights work very well, too.  Congratulations.</td>', 'This image captures my attention and makes me study it for longer time spans than most images here.  What''s reflection and what''s not?  Why is there crystal clear focus on the edge of the sphere at the center and yet the people shown on that sphere are totally fuzzy?  Why is the woman to the left of the sphere being seen thru the straight lines?  It''s just very interesting.  And the color scheme and contrasts between darks and lights work very well, too.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-13 18:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(908150, 105136, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nicely done with good DOF and a simple color scheme and compostion!<br/>TC</td>', 'Nicely done with good DOF and a simple color scheme and compostion!TC', '2004-09-13 18:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(908152, 104821, 9906, '<td valign="top">IMHO you have too much face and not enough reflection.  Given an opp for a reshoot (which I''m assuming won''t be easy...)  Get CLOSER!<br/>TC</td>', 'IMHO you have too much face and not enough reflection.  Given an opp for a reshoot (which I''m assuming won''t be easy...)  Get CLOSER!TC', '2004-09-13 18:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(908156, 105043, 9906, '<td valign="top">LOL  Nice idea!  (see my Ooops challenge entry!)  There is too much in the background though that takes your eye away from the faux reflection in the mirror.  A different parking space might help.<br/>TC</td>', 'LOL  Nice idea!  (see my Ooops challenge entry!)  There is too much in the background though that takes your eye away from the faux reflection in the mirror.  A different parking space might help.TC', '2004-09-13 18:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(908158, 104110, 23338, '<td valign="top">I originally rated this image much lower - it had seemed so plain and almost hokey to me at first.  The more that I saw it, the more that feeling went away - to be replaced instead with an appreciation for the balance of the color scheme, the cleverness of the idea, and the tremendous focus and detail in the repetitive pattern displayed by the mirror.  Congratulations.  Nice image.</td>', 'I originally rated this image much lower - it had seemed so plain and almost hokey to me at first.  The more that I saw it, the more that feeling went away - to be replaced instead with an appreciation for the balance of the color scheme, the cleverness of the idea, and the tremendous focus and detail in the repetitive pattern displayed by the mirror.  Congratulations.  Nice image.', '2004-09-13 18:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(908167, 103808, 23338, '<td valign="top">Very striking image in terms of motion, perspective, contrasts and detail.  I also likethe subtle capture of the passenger and  the repetition introduced by the mirror, the train windows, the station lights, the poles, the bricks, etc.  Congratulations on a really nice submission.</td>', 'Very striking image in terms of motion, perspective, contrasts and detail.  I also likethe subtle capture of the passenger and  the repetition introduced by the mirror, the train windows, the station lights, the poles, the bricks, etc.  Congratulations on a really nice submission.', '2004-09-13 18:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(908174, 104391, 23338, '<td valign="top">Talk about mirrors and reflections.  You captured them galore.  Nice focus, fabulous colors, well posed composition, striking contrast between darks and lights.  Might have cropped off just a tad too much at the bottom.  Never-the-less, really nice image.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Talk about mirrors and reflections.  You captured them galore.  Nice focus, fabulous colors, well posed composition, striking contrast between darks and lights.  Might have cropped off just a tad too much at the bottom.  Never-the-less, really nice image.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-13 18:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(908178, 105042, 9906, '<td valign="top">hsteg?  Nicely composed.  Good job getting your model into the right location.  Looks a touch oversharpened?<br/>TC</td>', 'hsteg?  Nicely composed.  Good job getting your model into the right location.  Looks a touch oversharpened?TC', '2004-09-13 18:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(908180, 105054, 23338, '<td valign="top">Real nice contrast between colors in reflected image and plain gray of the building with the window mirrors.  What''s nice is that in addition to being an attractive image, the picture tells a story.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Real nice contrast between colors in reflected image and plain gray of the building with the window mirrors.  What''s nice is that in addition to being an attractive image, the picture tells a story.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-13 18:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(908187, 104891, 23338, '<td valign="top">Or finger ballet?  I really love the repetition and the contrasts.  Seems like it could have been just slightly more in focus, but, who knows.  It''s very effective as is.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Or finger ballet?  I really love the repetition and the contrasts.  Seems like it could have been just slightly more in focus, but, who knows.  It''s very effective as is.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-13 18:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(908188, 104252, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry you are getting comments on your focus being to soft.  Some don''t realize that people do this on purpose!  I realize that you were trying to stay out of the reflection, but the negative space on the top right detracts (IMHO)  Also not a big fan of the selective sepia effect here.  The pink ribbon doesn''t seem to have a purpose here.<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m sorry you are getting comments on your focus being to soft.  Some don''t realize that people do this on purpose!  I realize that you were trying to stay out of the reflection, but the negative space on the top right detracts (IMHO)  Also not a big fan of the selective sepia effect here.  The pink ribbon doesn''t seem to have a purpose here.TC', '2004-09-13 18:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(908195, 104775, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice job lining things up to get the compositional effect that you rtitle implies.  The lighting is VERY harsh.  You shot this during mid day didn''t you?  A different time of day would bring out the shadows and soften your highlights.  The reflection is quite oversharpened.<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice job lining things up to get the compositional effect that you rtitle implies.  The lighting is VERY harsh.  You shot this during mid day didn''t you?  A different time of day would bring out the shadows and soften your highlights.  The reflection is quite oversharpened.TC', '2004-09-13 18:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(908198, 104939, 23338, '<td valign="top">Ya just know there has to be a mirror in there.  Right between the bases of the two typewriter images.   But, darn, it''s hard to see.  Everything is so perfectly focused - just half of it is reversed.    Anyway, overall it is a very nice image.</td>', 'Ya just know there has to be a mirror in there.  Right between the bases of the two typewriter images.   But, darn, it''s hard to see.  Everything is so perfectly focused - just half of it is reversed.    Anyway, overall it is a very nice image.', '2004-09-13 18:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(908199, 104967, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!  Can''t wait to see camera settings.  Were both vehicles moving?  Was this taken outside driver or passenger side?<br/>TC</td>', 'Nicely done!  Can''t wait to see camera settings.  Were both vehicles moving?  Was this taken outside driver or passenger side?TC', '2004-09-13 18:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(908201, 105116, 22010, '<td valign="top">I hope people give you the benefit of the doubt with the mirror. Some people might not see it. This makes it very effective on me. Only thing I would''ve done differently, is a border and more cropping. The red platform that is on the far right lower corner is distracting from the symmetry of this shot. Nice picture!</td>', 'I hope people give you the benefit of the doubt with the mirror. Some people might not see it. This makes it very effective on me. Only thing I would''ve done differently, is a border and more cropping. The red platform that is on the far right lower corner is distracting from the symmetry of this shot. Nice picture!', '2004-09-13 18:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(908203, 105046, 23338, '<td valign="top">I just love these kind of images.  The repetition and the geometric perspectives are so entertaining.  Wonder why the images in some panes are so smooth and the images in the next pain over are so distorted?  Has to do with the glass used, I''m sure.  But it IS a cool visual phenomena.  Like the contrasts, your composition and the detail.  Congratulations.</td>', 'I just love these kind of images.  The repetition and the geometric perspectives are so entertaining.  Wonder why the images in some panes are so smooth and the images in the next pain over are so distorted?  Has to do with the glass used, I''m sure.  But it IS a cool visual phenomena.  Like the contrasts, your composition and the detail.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-13 18:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(908204, 105038, 22010, '<td valign="top">This is great! Nice idea and setup. The cropping is excellent as is the light.</td>', 'This is great! Nice idea and setup. The cropping is excellent as is the light.', '2004-09-13 19:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(908206, 104542, 23338, '<td valign="top">This is such a cool abstract.  The color combinations, the overall tone and common level of focus, the weird patterns formed - all of them combine to make a very attractive and entertaining image.</td>', 'This is such a cool abstract.  The color combinations, the overall tone and common level of focus, the weird patterns formed - all of them combine to make a very attractive and entertaining image.', '2004-09-13 19:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(908207, 103558, 9906, '<td valign="top">The background in your reflection is extremely blown out.  What time of day did you attempt this?  It may be an impossible exposure without combining (bracketed) images which is illegal in the challenges and damn near impossible with a live subject.  You also appear to be overly sharpened.<br/>TC</td>', 'The background in your reflection is extremely blown out.  What time of day did you attempt this?  It may be an impossible exposure without combining (bracketed) images which is illegal in the challenges and damn near impossible with a live subject.  You also appear to be overly sharpened.TC', '2004-09-13 19:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(908208, 104913, 9906, '<td valign="top">This would be a nice shot for a reflection without mirrors challenge, but this challenge is called ''Mirrors''.<br/>TC</td>', 'This would be a nice shot for a reflection without mirrors challenge, but this challenge is called ''Mirrors''.TC', '2004-09-13 19:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(908209, 105015, 9906, '<td valign="top">Too abstract for my taste.<br/>TC</td>', 'Too abstract for my taste.TC', '2004-09-13 19:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(908217, 105021, 23338, '<td valign="top">So cool!  Really exciting image.  Great contrasts, colors and imagination.  Just wish the rest of that bottom reflection hadn''t been cut off.  Congratulations.</td>', 'So cool!  Really exciting image.  Great contrasts, colors and imagination.  Just wish the rest of that bottom reflection hadn''t been cut off.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-13 19:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(908220, 105047, 23338, '<td valign="top">Oh, man!  So abstract.  So smooth.  Really nice image.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Oh, man!  So abstract.  So smooth.  Really nice image.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-13 19:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(908225, 104676, 23338, '<td valign="top">And triangles.  And rectangles.  A real maze of variety - ensuring that folks will stop to gawk.    Great image.  Love the color and the contrasts.    Why the ghost image around the top of the middle sphere?  Congratulations.</td>', 'And triangles.  And rectangles.  A real maze of variety - ensuring that folks will stop to gawk.    Great image.  Love the color and the contrasts.    Why the ghost image around the top of the middle sphere?  Congratulations.', '2004-09-13 19:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(908228, 104421, 23338, '<td valign="top">Such a strange and unusual image.  Wonder what inspired it ...  I find it very thought provoking.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Such a strange and unusual image.  Wonder what inspired it ...  I find it very thought provoking.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-13 19:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(908234, 103925, 23338, '<td valign="top">Very moody.  Almost "Star Wars - ish"  I''d try to get out that little bit of yellow highlight on the top of the pole, though.  That''s just me.  Nice image.</td>', 'Very moody.  Almost "Star Wars - ish"  I''d try to get out that little bit of yellow highlight on the top of the pole, though.  That''s just me.  Nice image.', '2004-09-13 19:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(908241, 103435, 23338, '<td valign="top">Yeh, there are mirrors in there - but, they are so small and so inconsequential in terms of a "mirror image" that ya almost can''t count them - anymore than the reflection of the sky on the hood.  Bet someone had to work with lots of polish and elbow grease to get them that way though.</td>', 'Yeh, there are mirrors in there - but, they are so small and so inconsequential in terms of a "mirror image" that ya almost can''t count them - anymore than the reflection of the sky on the hood.  Bet someone had to work with lots of polish and elbow grease to get them that way though.', '2004-09-13 19:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(908318, 104978, 3697, '<td valign="top">I bet alot of people will leave comments like "where is the mirror". I won''t be one of those people however :) To me, a mirror can be anything that gives a reflection and you have a very nice example here.</td>', 'I bet alot of people will leave comments like "where is the mirror". I won''t be one of those people however :) To me, a mirror can be anything that gives a reflection and you have a very nice example here.', '2004-09-13 20:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(908335, 104890, 25343, '<td valign="top">This photo (as I hope was intended) is terrifying.  Hitchcock comes immediately to mind.  Well done!</td>', 'This photo (as I hope was intended) is terrifying.  Hitchcock comes immediately to mind.  Well done!', '2004-09-13 20:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(908367, 105038, 19982, '<td valign="top">The concept is very interesting!  The photo is "okay", but maybe people will vote it up for the concept.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'The concept is very interesting!  The photo is "okay", but maybe people will vote it up for the concept.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-09-13 21:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(908369, 104408, 19982, '<td valign="top">Should I admit that I''m voting this one higher because she is cute?!?  Otherwise, the background and the forearm complicate the image...</td>', 'Should I admit that I''m voting this one higher because she is cute?!?  Otherwise, the background and the forearm complicate the image...', '2004-09-13 21:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(908370, 104831, 19982, '<td valign="top">An interesting concept and well executed!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'An interesting concept and well executed!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-09-13 21:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(908381, 105061, 19982, '<td valign="top">She''s adorable!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'She''s adorable!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-09-13 21:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(908384, 104110, 19982, '<td valign="top">The color is perfect, the rose is perfect, the framing and lighting are perfect.  My only complaint would be that it feels like the frame might not have been completely in focus - and it feels more like an accident than on purpose.  Probably you focused on the rose which, due to the reflection, was further away.  So probably a tiny bit more depth of field was all that was needed to make the frame perfect.  I do like this image.  I hope you do well in the challenge!</td>', 'The color is perfect, the rose is perfect, the framing and lighting are perfect.  My only complaint would be that it feels like the frame might not have been completely in focus - and it feels more like an accident than on purpose.  Probably you focused on the rose which, due to the reflection, was further away.  So probably a tiny bit more depth of field was all that was needed to make the frame perfect.  I do like this image.  I hope you do well in the challenge!', '2004-09-13 21:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(908385, 104978, 8860, '<td valign="top">Oooh - is this Mono Lake? I wanted to visit here when I went to Yosemite but ran out of time. It certainly looks worth it from this beautiful image.</td>', 'Oooh - is this Mono Lake? I wanted to visit here when I went to Yosemite but ran out of time. It certainly looks worth it from this beautiful image.', '2004-09-13 21:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(908387, 104498, 19982, '<td valign="top">I never knew horses were vain!  Awesome shot, I love how sharp it is.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I never knew horses were vain!  Awesome shot, I love how sharp it is.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-09-13 21:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(908390, 105020, 19982, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  :-)<br/> <br/>Somehow this image is striking...  from the perfection in the girl''s facial features, to the sharpness in the lines in the boards, to the "stunningly large and sharp" mirrors on her face.  I don''t know why this one works so well, but it does.<br/></td>', 'Whoa!  :-) Somehow this image is striking...  from the perfection in the girl''s facial features, to the sharpness in the lines in the boards, to the "stunningly large and sharp" mirrors on her face.  I don''t know why this one works so well, but it does.', '2004-09-13 21:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(908393, 104946, 19982, '<td valign="top">I dunno, the signo over her face just spoils it for me....</td>', 'I dunno, the signo over her face just spoils it for me....', '2004-09-13 21:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(908396, 104342, 19982, '<td valign="top">Of the many reflected images of people, I really like the pose in this one.  The framing works well as does the choice of b&amp;w.  Well done!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Of the many reflected images of people, I really like the pose in this one.  The framing works well as does the choice of b&w.  Well done!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-09-13 21:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(908398, 104252, 19982, '<td valign="top">The girl''s back is perfectly in focus.  The one thing that could have made this image even better would have been to increase the depth of field to where the girl''s reflection was also perfectly in focus.</td>', 'The girl''s back is perfectly in focus.  The one thing that could have made this image even better would have been to increase the depth of field to where the girl''s reflection was also perfectly in focus.', '2004-09-13 21:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
