(908698, 103566, 22046, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of color in this. And it is a unique take on the subject. A favorite of mine.</td>', 'Wonderful use of color in this. And it is a unique take on the subject. A favorite of mine.', '2004-09-14 01:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(908701, 105136, 22046, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed. I also like the subtly rich colors.</td>', 'Very nicely composed. I also like the subtly rich colors.', '2004-09-14 01:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(908703, 104939, 22046, '<td valign="top">Was about to complain about lack of mirror and then I saw it... I like that the mirror use is subtle. Sepia works very well on this and the graphic effect fits the antique subject matter. Well done.</td>', 'Was about to complain about lack of mirror and then I saw it... I like that the mirror use is subtle. Sepia works very well on this and the graphic effect fits the antique subject matter. Well done.', '2004-09-14 01:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(908704, 104521, 22046, '<td valign="top">Very well composed. The lighting is great. The tones of light and dark balance  beautifully. And the focus is sharp throughout. Yep. I like this.</td>', 'Very well composed. The lighting is great. The tones of light and dark balance  beautifully. And the focus is sharp throughout. Yep. I like this.', '2004-09-14 01:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(908706, 104725, 22046, '<td valign="top">One of the better self portraits in this challenge. I like the simplicity and the balance of the composition.</td>', 'One of the better self portraits in this challenge. I like the simplicity and the balance of the composition.', '2004-09-14 01:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(908709, 104676, 22046, '<td valign="top">Quite elegant and beautiful.</td>', 'Quite elegant and beautiful.', '2004-09-14 01:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(908710, 105023, 22046, '<td valign="top">This works well. My only complaint is the highlight on the clock which is a bit blown out. Still the composition is very good and the picture evokes a more peaceful time.</td>', 'This works well. My only complaint is the highlight on the clock which is a bit blown out. Still the composition is very good and the picture evokes a more peaceful time.', '2004-09-14 01:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(908712, 105108, 22046, '<td valign="top">Good catch. How long did you have to wait for him? The focus is sharp through out which helps and the light is just right to highlight his face. Good one.</td>', 'Good catch. How long did you have to wait for him? The focus is sharp through out which helps and the light is just right to highlight his face. Good one.', '2004-09-14 01:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(908713, 105061, 22046, '<td valign="top">This is oen of the best "reflected kid" photos in this challenge. You''ve got the light on her face and the composition draws our eyes right to her wonderful smile. Normally I wouldn''t like the fade out on the edges but I think it works fine here. Good one.</td>', 'This is oen of the best "reflected kid" photos in this challenge. You''ve got the light on her face and the composition draws our eyes right to her wonderful smile. Normally I wouldn''t like the fade out on the edges but I think it works fine here. Good one.', '2004-09-14 01:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(908715, 105025, 22046, '<td valign="top">So very cleverly done. I think your use of desaturation and color works very well to point out the fact that part of the scene is in the morror, Great illusion</td>', 'So very cleverly done. I think your use of desaturation and color works very well to point out the fact that part of the scene is in the morror, Great illusion', '2004-09-14 01:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(908717, 105046, 22046, '<td valign="top">Makes me dizzy. Great abstract reflection</td>', 'Makes me dizzy. Great abstract reflection', '2004-09-14 01:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(908721, 103713, 22046, '<td valign="top">This feels very zen to me...  like the balls are floating in the air rather than moving due to juggling. I might have called it "In Suspension" but never mind that. It works very well. It is the sharp focus that makes it work so well, and the effective lighting.</td>', 'This feels very zen to me...  like the balls are floating in the air rather than moving due to juggling. I might have called it "In Suspension" but never mind that. It works very well. It is the sharp focus that makes it work so well, and the effective lighting.', '2004-09-14 01:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(908769, 104408, 24459, '<td valign="top">A very nice picture and a beautiful model. At first I felt like it would use some colour adjusting (maybe more saturated, maybe less) but after looking at this photo a bit longer I think the colours are just fine - tender and calm.<br/>One of my favourites</td>', 'A very nice picture and a beautiful model. At first I felt like it would use some colour adjusting (maybe more saturated, maybe less) but after looking at this photo a bit longer I think the colours are just fine - tender and calm.One of my favourites', '2004-09-14 02:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(908797, 104947, 23338, '<td valign="top">It took me awhile to realize that there WAS a mirror; that I was seeing two sides of the same coin.  The color schemes being different, it was hard to tie them together.  And, I was wondering what that bigger green out-of-focus blob was.  Anyway, it was very hard to see or understand a mirror at first.</td>', 'It took me awhile to realize that there WAS a mirror; that I was seeing two sides of the same coin.  The color schemes being different, it was hard to tie them together.  And, I was wondering what that bigger green out-of-focus blob was.  Anyway, it was very hard to see or understand a mirror at first.', '2004-09-14 03:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(908799, 104507, 23338, '<td valign="top">Unless someone told me that there was supposed to be a mirror shown in this challenge, I would have sworn you were showing me two peaches.</td>', 'Unless someone told me that there was supposed to be a mirror shown in this challenge, I would have sworn you were showing me two peaches.', '2004-09-14 03:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(908801, 104488, 23338, '<td valign="top">Very difficult in this image to come up with - "Hey, look at the mirror!"  At first it just appears like a bunch of ballons.  Nice pretty ones, but just balloons.  No mirror.</td>', 'Very difficult in this image to come up with - "Hey, look at the mirror!"  At first it just appears like a bunch of ballons.  Nice pretty ones, but just balloons.  No mirror.', '2004-09-14 03:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(908803, 104786, 23338, '<td valign="top">Yeh, I know that is supposed to be a mirror image in the background.  That''s what this challenge is about: mirrors.  But, unless you knew that, it just looks like a distant, out of focus unicorn similar to the one in front.</td>', 'Yeh, I know that is supposed to be a mirror image in the background.  That''s what this challenge is about: mirrors.  But, unless you knew that, it just looks like a distant, out of focus unicorn similar to the one in front.', '2004-09-14 03:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(908805, 105065, 23338, '<td valign="top">If I were going to rate this image higher it would need to have focus, some kind of interesting detail in the image, and I''d want to lose that garish yellow light above it.  Even then, I''d be struggling how to make it appear as an enticing image.</td>', 'If I were going to rate this image higher it would need to have focus, some kind of interesting detail in the image, and I''d want to lose that garish yellow light above it.  Even then, I''d be struggling how to make it appear as an enticing image.', '2004-09-14 03:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(908808, 104513, 23338, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, this looks like someone working to take a picture of themself.   You need to make it interesting.  Could it be framed so that your arm doesn''t look like its holding up a camera?  Maybe you could attempt to show yourself with some particular mood like sorrow or joy, or you could try and portray yourself as some famous person.  Technically, the image isn''t all that bad, but natural lighting might eliminate the shadow effect on the wall behind the "real" person.  You could also hang a black backdrop and remove the slightly seen, but distracting curtains, etc., in the back ground in the mirror.  Anyway, those are my thoughts.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Unfortunately, this looks like someone working to take a picture of themself.   You need to make it interesting.  Could it be framed so that your arm doesn''t look like its holding up a camera?  Maybe you could attempt to show yourself with some particular mood like sorrow or joy, or you could try and portray yourself as some famous person.  Technically, the image isn''t all that bad, but natural lighting might eliminate the shadow effect on the wall behind the "real" person.  You could also hang a black backdrop and remove the slightly seen, but distracting curtains, etc., in the back ground in the mirror.  Anyway, those are my thoughts.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-14 04:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(908858, 105130, 25140, '<td valign="top">I missed it at first.  I like it.</td>', 'I missed it at first.  I like it.', '2004-09-14 05:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
