(909368, 103558, 10985, '<td valign="top">Very sweet. Would have been superb if not blurry. It looks like he/she moved quickly as you took the shot.</td>', 'Very sweet. Would have been superb if not blurry. It looks like he/she moved quickly as you took the shot.', '2004-09-14 13:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(909371, 104862, 23338, '<td valign="top">Please don''t take this wrong, but these little guys irritate me.  :-)   Normally, when I see them, I go, "Oh, shoot!  Those stupid little dummies again.  They need to be the subject of an ''Oh, No, Mr. Bill'' cartoon"  In other words, squash ''em, burn ''em, smash ''em, rip ''em, blow ''em up, etc.  However, this time, I really had to laugh.  They actually made a well balanced, interesting and colorfully contrasting image.  What irritated me more at that point was I couldn''t really grade them terribly low.  Rats.  And congratulations, I guess...    :-)</td>', 'Please don''t take this wrong, but these little guys irritate me.  :-)   Normally, when I see them, I go, "Oh, shoot!  Those stupid little dummies again.  They need to be the subject of an ''Oh, No, Mr. Bill'' cartoon"  In other words, squash ''em, burn ''em, smash ''em, rip ''em, blow ''em up, etc.  However, this time, I really had to laugh.  They actually made a well balanced, interesting and colorfully contrasting image.  What irritated me more at that point was I couldn''t really grade them terribly low.  Rats.  And congratulations, I guess...    :-)', '2004-09-14 13:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(909374, 105095, 10985, '<td valign="top">I like that only one reflection is sharp (or maybe it''s the model). Very cool.</td>', 'I like that only one reflection is sharp (or maybe it''s the model). Very cool.', '2004-09-14 13:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(909380, 104349, 23338, '<td valign="top">I don''t really understand this in terms of a "mirror"; looks more like an out of focus TV screen inside the shirt.  The psychological thought process behind the image is sort of interesting though; some sort of metaphorical symbolism in there somewhere, I''m sure:  Man, football, blood, soul, etc. ...  Anyway, good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t really understand this in terms of a "mirror"; looks more like an out of focus TV screen inside the shirt.  The psychological thought process behind the image is sort of interesting though; some sort of metaphorical symbolism in there somewhere, I''m sure:  Man, football, blood, soul, etc. ...  Anyway, good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-14 14:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(909381, 104862, 10985, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little busy, but very cool. I would have like the photographer not to show.</td>', 'Maybe a little busy, but very cool. I would have like the photographer not to show.', '2004-09-14 14:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(909391, 104821, 23338, '<td valign="top">Barry Bonds at the plate?  Interesting view - I''ve done similar before, specifically one shot from below looking up from in front as the subject was standing in front of Mickey Mouse, who then showed in the sun glasses.   You don''t need much more DOF; what you''ve got is OK.  Could still burn out even more of that background though.   Just my opinion.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Barry Bonds at the plate?  Interesting view - I''ve done similar before, specifically one shot from below looking up from in front as the subject was standing in front of Mickey Mouse, who then showed in the sun glasses.   You don''t need much more DOF; what you''ve got is OK.  Could still burn out even more of that background though.   Just my opinion.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-14 14:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(909403, 105025, 23338, '<td valign="top">Hope someone was watching traffic while you took this.  Nice lineup, other than it appears the top mid-ground line on the left (the last stretch of level land before the mountain) doesn''t seem to line up with the correct line outside of the mirror frame.   Very creative idea.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Hope someone was watching traffic while you took this.  Nice lineup, other than it appears the top mid-ground line on the left (the last stretch of level land before the mountain) doesn''t seem to line up with the correct line outside of the mirror frame.   Very creative idea.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-14 14:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(909406, 104129, 23338, '<td valign="top">On her elbows?  Was Katydid dead?  Poor thing (either way).  Did you try "No Red Eye"?  Otherwise, nice image.  Colorful, bright, nice contrasts and focus.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'On her elbows?  Was Katydid dead?  Poor thing (either way).  Did you try "No Red Eye"?  Otherwise, nice image.  Colorful, bright, nice contrasts and focus.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-14 14:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
