(909952, 104924, 12253, '<td valign="top">This was a very good idea and generally well done.  I wonder however if it might have been better to place some more light on the person being reflected--they seem dark and "flat" (except for the lips!)  (Also, watch for the light side/behind the mirror which is blowing out the edge of it.)  But in general, great effort.</td>', 'This was a very good idea and generally well done.  I wonder however if it might have been better to place some more light on the person being reflected--they seem dark and "flat" (except for the lips!)  (Also, watch for the light side/behind the mirror which is blowing out the edge of it.)  But in general, great effort.', '2004-09-14 21:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
