(910075, 103808, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is just a completely fascinating shot.  Superb!!  I''m going to assume that the  sign posts are holding mirrors or some sort of reflective surface (it''s hard to tell what they are) and am scoring it high.  It is such a great shot and deserves to be up there.  I hope others see it that way as well.  Excellent!</td>', 'This is just a completely fascinating shot.  Superb!!  I''m going to assume that the  sign posts are holding mirrors or some sort of reflective surface (it''s hard to tell what they are) and am scoring it high.  It is such a great shot and deserves to be up there.  I hope others see it that way as well.  Excellent!', '2004-09-14 22:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(910084, 104795, 14620, '<td valign="top">Striking shot.  Absolutely love it.  Great tones and contrasts.  The composition and the background reflection gives it a tad bit of an abstract feel, very crisp.  For some strange reason, I feel compelled to clean up that spill. :-)  Nice job.</td>', 'Striking shot.  Absolutely love it.  Great tones and contrasts.  The composition and the background reflection gives it a tad bit of an abstract feel, very crisp.  For some strange reason, I feel compelled to clean up that spill. :-)  Nice job.', '2004-09-14 22:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
