(910260, 104831, 7778, '<td valign="top">Quite an appealing image, well composed and edited (to contain highlights?). Both pespective (triangulation of square) and the single cropped mirror tile (at right edge) adds a welcome deliberate feeling to the geometry of the arrangement.<br/> <br/>Given the relative underexposure of the ground cover, a very satisfying balance has been achieved between the acrcane and the stark. The larger depth of field evident here appears to make child''s play of the conceivable difficulty to render both the tiles and their reflected images in focus.<br/> <br/>The photograph also appears to avoid easy clichées often associated with mirrors, and, instead, radiates a clear and reflective quality. There are no better or comparable works, I could find, in this challenge.</td>', 'Quite an appealing image, well composed and edited (to contain highlights?). Both pespective (triangulation of square) and the single cropped mirror tile (at right edge) adds a welcome deliberate feeling to the geometry of the arrangement. Given the relative underexposure of the ground cover, a very satisfying balance has been achieved between the acrcane and the stark. The larger depth of field evident here appears to make child''s play of the conceivable difficulty to render both the tiles and their reflected images in focus. The photograph also appears to avoid easy clichées often associated with mirrors, and, instead, radiates a clear and reflective quality. There are no better or comparable works, I could find, in this challenge.', '2004-09-15 00:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(910261, 105061, 20324, '<td valign="top">i like the picture but i dont like the border (9)</td>', 'i like the picture but i dont like the border (9)', '2004-09-15 00:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(910268, 105027, 20324, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition. I like the cool colors. However, I wish that the lines were parallel to the border. (9)</td>', 'Very interesting composition. I like the cool colors. However, I wish that the lines were parallel to the border. (9)', '2004-09-15 00:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
