(911530, 104946, 20889, '<td valign="top">Bet your getting alot of views? Should have put the mirror down below her waist made us think something more going on here IMO. Still pretty good photo. A bit bright around the right arm and waist maybe back the light off a bit. Nice theme 9.</td>', 'Bet your getting alot of views? Should have put the mirror down below her waist made us think something more going on here IMO. Still pretty good photo. A bit bright around the right arm and waist maybe back the light off a bit. Nice theme 9.', '2004-09-15 13:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(911535, 104996, 20889, '<td valign="top">This has alot of story to it. Either you just had a fight and he got out or he is someone you just passed by and thinking of turning around to give a ride. Its good 10.</td>', 'This has alot of story to it. Either you just had a fight and he got out or he is someone you just passed by and thinking of turning around to give a ride. Its good 10.', '2004-09-15 14:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
