(911594, 104343, 8624, '<td valign="top">I love this new sculpture and the rest of Millenium Park as well. You have done a nice job capturing the fun that results from the cast reflections on this amazing piece of public art. I would suggest, however, that you consider editing the barrel distortion of the buildings</td>', 'I love this new sculpture and the rest of Millenium Park as well. You have done a nice job capturing the fun that results from the cast reflections on this amazing piece of public art. I would suggest, however, that you consider editing the barrel distortion of the buildings', '2004-09-15 14:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(911613, 104951, 8624, '<td valign="top">great idea, but it''s a little dark (the photo, not the idea... wait, the idea is too, but that''s OK...) I think this would have been more effective with a wider tonal range in the image</td>', 'great idea, but it''s a little dark (the photo, not the idea... wait, the idea is too, but that''s OK...) I think this would have been more effective with a wider tonal range in the image', '2004-09-15 15:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
