(911688, 104890, 24642, '<td valign="top">HELP !! Scary stuff, really captures the Alfred Hitchcock feel.  I can''t understand how this is done and would like to see how you did this. Good job.</td>', 'HELP !! Scary stuff, really captures the Alfred Hitchcock feel.  I can''t understand how this is done and would like to see how you did this. Good job.', '2004-09-15 16:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
