(911702, 105066, 12362, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture and idea, my only suggestion would be to enlarge the aperature so that the pot would be more in focus. Great shot.</td>', 'Very nice picture and idea, my only suggestion would be to enlarge the aperature so that the pot would be more in focus. Great shot.', '2004-09-15 16:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
