(912555, 104685, 26847, '<td valign="top">Composition is weak, lighting is 2D and the focus isn''t sharp enough.  That''s the major technical flaws.  Photos are supposed to tell stories.  This one is mixed and confusing, particularly with the name of the photo.  Is the man in the center an accident or on purpose?  I don''t know.  Either way, I have no idea what this is supposed to tell me.</td>', 'Composition is weak, lighting is 2D and the focus isn''t sharp enough.  That''s the major technical flaws.  Photos are supposed to tell stories.  This one is mixed and confusing, particularly with the name of the photo.  Is the man in the center an accident or on purpose?  I don''t know.  Either way, I have no idea what this is supposed to tell me.', '2004-09-16 03:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(912558, 105137, 26847, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea, but the execution is weak.  Because of the angle you chose the image appears to be uot of focus or accidentally doubled rather than using a mirror on purpose.  Next time consider using a thicker mirror (which will separate the reflect from the water colors even farther) and alter the angle.  Work on your focus and exposure as well.</td>', 'Excellent idea, but the execution is weak.  Because of the angle you chose the image appears to be uot of focus or accidentally doubled rather than using a mirror on purpose.  Next time consider using a thicker mirror (which will separate the reflect from the water colors even farther) and alter the angle.  Work on your focus and exposure as well.', '2004-09-16 03:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(912560, 104073, 26847, '<td valign="top">Foreground is out of focus.  It doesn''t feel like a deliberate choice.  The smoke is too little to be truly dramatic.  The lighting is too harsh.  Use a softer light source so it will feel less like a photographer''s lighting kit next to a subject.  Foreground contrast and color saturation is poor.</td>', 'Foreground is out of focus.  It doesn''t feel like a deliberate choice.  The smoke is too little to be truly dramatic.  The lighting is too harsh.  Use a softer light source so it will feel less like a photographer''s lighting kit next to a subject.  Foreground contrast and color saturation is poor.', '2004-09-16 03:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(912562, 105116, 26847, '<td valign="top">Composition is awful.  You''ve cropped off the bottom of your subject!  IT''s not truly centered!  Your use of negative space on the right is sloppy.  Since your subject is based on symmetry, then you need to take the time to make it TRULY symmetrical.  Be more patient with your work and demonstrate a dedication to craftsmanship.</td>', 'Composition is awful.  You''ve cropped off the bottom of your subject!  IT''s not truly centered!  Your use of negative space on the right is sloppy.  Since your subject is based on symmetry, then you need to take the time to make it TRULY symmetrical.  Be more patient with your work and demonstrate a dedication to craftsmanship.', '2004-09-16 03:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(912563, 105126, 4267, '<td valign="top">interesting idea of mirror in a mirror.. but honestly overall it is boring and out of focus... sorry</td>', 'interesting idea of mirror in a mirror.. but honestly overall it is boring and out of focus... sorry', '2004-09-16 03:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
