(912847, 105042, 22288, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but I think it would have been a little stronger if the feathers along the back of the bird were a little bit sharper?</td>', 'I like the shot, but I think it would have been a little stronger if the feathers along the back of the bird were a little bit sharper?', '2004-09-16 09:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(912848, 104831, 22288, '<td valign="top">Really neat shot, very creative. The clounds in the top part of the mirror are a bit strong though almost distracting.</td>', 'Really neat shot, very creative. The clounds in the top part of the mirror are a bit strong though almost distracting.', '2004-09-16 09:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(912853, 103616, 22288, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, I think the picture would have more impact from a diffrent angle though. Just a thought</td>', 'I like the idea, I think the picture would have more impact from a diffrent angle though. Just a thought', '2004-09-16 09:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(912854, 105028, 22288, '<td valign="top">I like the compostion of this shot, but I think the shot would have been better with more DOF</td>', 'I like the compostion of this shot, but I think the shot would have been better with more DOF', '2004-09-16 09:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(912855, 104725, 16241, '<td valign="top">hmm wonder who this could be?</td>', 'hmm wonder who this could be?', '2004-09-16 09:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(912856, 104342, 22288, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. A bit dark towards the bottom losing some detail in her legs.</td>', 'Nice picture. A bit dark towards the bottom losing some detail in her legs.', '2004-09-16 09:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(912861, 105087, 22288, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, really stands out.</td>', 'Neat shot, really stands out.', '2004-09-16 09:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(912879, 104736, 22288, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, it really stands out and gets your attention. Nice colors.</td>', 'Very nice shot, it really stands out and gets your attention. Nice colors.', '2004-09-16 09:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(912923, 104862, 25475, '<td valign="top">Remindes me of Fun Houses at carnivals</td>', 'Remindes me of Fun Houses at carnivals', '2004-09-16 11:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(912926, 105052, 25475, '<td valign="top">I love the ilook of the photo</td>', 'I love the ilook of the photo', '2004-09-16 11:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(913002, 105002, 20375, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus and use of texture.<br/>Top ten!</td>', 'Excellent focus and use of texture.Top ten!', '2004-09-16 12:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(913004, 104795, 20375, '<td valign="top">Duotone was a good choice for this shot. Background colour I''m sure would have confused the viewer. Nice effect.</td>', 'Duotone was a good choice for this shot. Background colour I''m sure would have confused the viewer. Nice effect.', '2004-09-16 12:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(913006, 104725, 20375, '<td valign="top">Good variation on a theme using the challenge criteria of mirrors.<br/>Well done, creative.</td>', 'Good variation on a theme using the challenge criteria of mirrors.Well done, creative.', '2004-09-16 12:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(913008, 104855, 20375, '<td valign="top">Nice job. Your model''s pose is relaxed. Combined with good technical execution (focus, exposure, dof etc) it is a pleasing image to look at. <br/>Creatively......unique.</td>', 'Nice job. Your model''s pose is relaxed. Combined with good technical execution (focus, exposure, dof etc) it is a pleasing image to look at. Creatively......unique.', '2004-09-16 12:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(913011, 104951, 20375, '<td valign="top">Wow. I wondered about the picture being too dark but then...the darkness lends to the "feeling" you are trying to convey. <br/>Simple but very effective idea ... well done.</td>', 'Wow. I wondered about the picture being too dark but then...the darkness lends to the "feeling" you are trying to convey. Simple but very effective idea ... well done.', '2004-09-16 12:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(913017, 104736, 20375, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Love the close in perspective to the mirror ball. <br/>Where did you find tulips this time of year? (I''m in the north)<br/>nice colour, I might have increased saturation just a bit....but that''s a personal choice. You did good here.</td>', 'Nice shot. Love the close in perspective to the mirror ball. Where did you find tulips this time of year? (I''m in the north)nice colour, I might have increased saturation just a bit....but that''s a personal choice. You did good here.', '2004-09-16 12:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(913019, 105043, 8624, '<td valign="top">cute idea. a polarizer would have helped get rid of the dashboard reflections on the windshield. also, the strip of interior car roof at the top is pretty distracting. consider cropping it out.</td>', 'cute idea. a polarizer would have helped get rid of the dashboard reflections on the windshield. also, the strip of interior car roof at the top is pretty distracting. consider cropping it out.', '2004-09-16 12:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(913020, 104924, 20375, '<td valign="top">Very simple, effective shot.<br/>You should score well. My only criticism is it is a bit too dark. But hell, I like the shot! Good idea, well done.</td>', 'Very simple, effective shot.You should score well. My only criticism is it is a bit too dark. But hell, I like the shot! Good idea, well done.', '2004-09-16 12:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(913022, 104721, 20375, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot! Good perspective</td>', 'Excellent shot! Good perspective', '2004-09-16 12:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(913023, 105015, 8624, '<td valign="top">fantastic point of view - very creative angle for the shot! I really wish the couple was either not so darkly lit or so out of focus or both, however, because without your title I might not have recognized them as people. this is a great idea with good lighting, but suffers slightly in the execution.</td>', 'fantastic point of view - very creative angle for the shot! I really wish the couple was either not so darkly lit or so out of focus or both, however, because without your title I might not have recognized them as people. this is a great idea with good lighting, but suffers slightly in the execution.', '2004-09-16 12:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(913024, 104821, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the the ballfield is reflected - that provides good context for the shot and helps tell the story. I would have removed the beer cup from the ledge. I also wish the focus was sharper. The glasses look pretty good but the rest of the facial features are pretty soft.</td>', 'I like the the ballfield is reflected - that provides good context for the shot and helps tell the story. I would have removed the beer cup from the ledge. I also wish the focus was sharper. The glasses look pretty good but the rest of the facial features are pretty soft.', '2004-09-16 12:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(913027, 104685, 8624, '<td valign="top">good idea - might have been better from a slightly different angle. as shot, the pole slices the frame in two and itself distrcats from the rest of the carosel. Peerhaps a shot with one of the horse heads as the main subject with a mirrow behind it would have provided stronger compositional elements.</td>', 'good idea - might have been better from a slightly different angle. as shot, the pole slices the frame in two and itself distrcats from the rest of the carosel. Peerhaps a shot with one of the horse heads as the main subject with a mirrow behind it would have provided stronger compositional elements.', '2004-09-16 12:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(913029, 103616, 8624, '<td valign="top">cute girl, cute pose. I would have selected a shirt without a distracting logo, however.</td>', 'cute girl, cute pose. I would have selected a shirt without a distracting logo, however.', '2004-09-16 12:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(913033, 104855, 8139, '<td valign="top">Seems simple, but the execution is very well done. Technically I see no flaws. I could discuss about the cropping, but ...I like it as it is :)  10</td>', 'Seems simple, but the execution is very well done. Technically I see no flaws. I could discuss about the cropping, but ...I like it as it is :)  10', '2004-09-16 12:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(913036, 105071, 8624, '<td valign="top">good point of view and nice lighting. I wish the hot spots on the side of his face weren''t so strong though.</td>', 'good point of view and nice lighting. I wish the hot spots on the side of his face weren''t so strong though.', '2004-09-16 12:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(913039, 104349, 8624, '<td valign="top">very clever and well done! I like the the reflected image from the TV screen is just blurry enough to be still recognizable. I wish the very top of the mirror image wasn''t blank though. a minor point - this is a fun and well executed shot.</td>', 'very clever and well done! I like the the reflected image from the TV screen is just blurry enough to be still recognizable. I wish the very top of the mirror image wasn''t blank though. a minor point - this is a fun and well executed shot.', '2004-09-16 12:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
