(915055, 105028, 19608, '<td valign="top">A nice image, well composed and exposed.  Compositionally, the left shoulder is a major component which detracts... and I wonder why you rotated it 90 degrees.</td>', 'A nice image, well composed and exposed.  Compositionally, the left shoulder is a major component which detracts... and I wonder why you rotated it 90 degrees.', '2004-09-17 21:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
