(915672, 104902, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nice picture but the base of the mirror takes away from it. I would have put the vase on a stand and taken the picture from a more horizontal direction with a greater DOF Or maybe from a greater angle and tried to capture the reflection of the vases that are in the mirror on the table they are on.</td>', 'Nice picture but the base of the mirror takes away from it. I would have put the vase on a stand and taken the picture from a more horizontal direction with a greater DOF Or maybe from a greater angle and tried to capture the reflection of the vases that are in the mirror on the table they are on.', '2004-09-18 09:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(915673, 104924, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2004-09-18 09:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(915676, 104488, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like the festive nature of the picture. The reflections of light actually add to the idea. Looks like a Party!</td>', 'I like the festive nature of the picture. The reflections of light actually add to the idea. Looks like a Party!', '2004-09-18 09:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(915681, 104978, 26930, '<td valign="top">Nice motive</td>', 'Nice motive', '2004-09-18 09:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(915717, 104826, 21362, '<td valign="top">I''m a little surprised by how much I love this one. It seems like such a mundane subject, but the composition of the lines and the soft dreamy colors really make it beautiful. It''s like a modern watercolor painting. Well done. My only 10 this challenge. :)</td>', 'I''m a little surprised by how much I love this one. It seems like such a mundane subject, but the composition of the lines and the soft dreamy colors really make it beautiful. It''s like a modern watercolor painting. Well done. My only 10 this challenge. :)', '2004-09-18 11:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(915718, 105057, 21362, '<td valign="top">Great candid/photojournalist-style shot. The pucker on the little girl''s face is perfect. Love it. :)</td>', 'Great candid/photojournalist-style shot. The pucker on the little girl''s face is perfect. Love it. :)', '2004-09-18 11:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(915719, 104349, 21362, '<td valign="top">Great creative idea.</td>', 'Great creative idea.', '2004-09-18 11:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(915722, 104725, 25754, '<td valign="top">One of my faves. Very creative and well done!</td>', 'One of my faves. Very creative and well done!', '2004-09-18 11:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(915734, 104854, 15575, '<td valign="top">Did you use an extra mirror so the text isn''t back to front??  Nice macro tho</td>', 'Did you use an extra mirror so the text isn''t back to front??  Nice macro tho', '2004-09-18 11:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(915736, 105002, 15575, '<td valign="top">How did you do this?  Its amasing, really stands out from the crowd!! 10</td>', 'How did you do this?  Its amasing, really stands out from the crowd!! 10', '2004-09-18 11:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(915806, 105054, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice!  I pity people with slow connections for this picture though.</td>', 'Nice!  I pity people with slow connections for this picture though.', '2004-09-18 13:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(915809, 105023, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice b/w picture.  I usually don''t comment on border treatments, but in this case the treatment bothers me just a bit.  IMHO it takes away from a picture that is quite strong on its own.  I think I would probably try a crop to just about where your "fuzzy" sections start.  But I may be wrong :)  It''s a very crisp shot though, looks a bit like it came out of a noir film.  I hope you do well in the challenge. ~8</td>', 'Nice b/w picture.  I usually don''t comment on border treatments, but in this case the treatment bothers me just a bit.  IMHO it takes away from a picture that is quite strong on its own.  I think I would probably try a crop to just about where your "fuzzy" sections start.  But I may be wrong :)  It''s a very crisp shot though, looks a bit like it came out of a noir film.  I hope you do well in the challenge. ~8', '2004-09-18 13:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(915810, 105071, 5112, '<td valign="top">Find any?  I like the clarity of the one eye.</td>', 'Find any?  I like the clarity of the one eye.', '2004-09-18 13:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
