(915812, 105057, 5112, '<td valign="top">The little girls expression is just darling!  What a cutie!  Does mum let her use lipstick?</td>', 'The little girls expression is just darling!  What a cutie!  Does mum let her use lipstick?', '2004-09-18 13:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
