(915822, 105043, 5112, '<td valign="top">Funny!</td>', 'Funny!', '2004-09-18 14:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(915823, 104900, 5112, '<td valign="top">I think this is the best of the many car mirror shots in this challenge.  I like this picture quite a bit, it''s one of those that grows on you the more you look at it.  I wonder what it would look with a bit more cropped off the top (1/3 to 1/2).  I hope you do well in the challenge. ~9<br/> <br/>Came back - upped to 10, this is my top pick this week.  I like this one.</td>', 'I think this is the best of the many car mirror shots in this challenge.  I like this picture quite a bit, it''s one of those that grows on you the more you look at it.  I wonder what it would look with a bit more cropped off the top (1/3 to 1/2).  I hope you do well in the challenge. ~9 Came back - upped to 10, this is my top pick this week.  I like this one.', '2004-09-18 14:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
