(915985, 104671, 25773, '<td valign="top">Yes, that''s the same (great) idea! The only thing that others noticed on my picture and probably it''s true here too that the surrounding of the camera should have been maximally ''neutralized'' for not to distract from the main point of the picture! I don''t know how much time you spent with it but it take a few shots to get sufficient clarity. Cheers!<br/>Gyorgy</td>', 'Yes, that''s the same (great) idea! The only thing that others noticed on my picture and probably it''s true here too that the surrounding of the camera should have been maximally ''neutralized'' for not to distract from the main point of the picture! I don''t know how much time you spent with it but it take a few shots to get sufficient clarity. Cheers!Gyorgy', '2004-09-18 17:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
