(916180, 105023, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice still life. Clarity is wonderful, and the arrangement seems balanced. To me, it evokes a fine mood, so I think your photo works! 8</td>', 'Very nice still life. Clarity is wonderful, and the arrangement seems balanced. To me, it evokes a fine mood, so I think your photo works! 8', '2004-09-19 00:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
