(916182, 104349, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun photo. The idea and effect are good. 8</td>', 'Fun photo. The idea and effect are good. 8', '2004-09-19 00:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(916190, 105125, 6870, '<td valign="top">Some interesting patterns here. I''m afraid there''s not much for me, personally, to grasp on to, so I''m having a hard time understanding it. Your major clues are mostly wires and a few soft focused lights, and it''s not adding up to anything in my brain. Some suggestions might be to select a different angle to  your communication is more clear. Lighting for a specific mood might also help. Or try getting your focus on one or two things that will really help you communicate what you want. My attention is on the ball of light up center. Then my eye goes to the telephone cord down left becaus it is most in focus. They then move up to the greenish double-lights at right. So this progression isn''t giving me enough data to form meaning. I hope this helps. Keep shooting!</td>', 'Some interesting patterns here. I''m afraid there''s not much for me, personally, to grasp on to, so I''m having a hard time understanding it. Your major clues are mostly wires and a few soft focused lights, and it''s not adding up to anything in my brain. Some suggestions might be to select a different angle to  your communication is more clear. Lighting for a specific mood might also help. Or try getting your focus on one or two things that will really help you communicate what you want. My attention is on the ball of light up center. Then my eye goes to the telephone cord down left becaus it is most in focus. They then move up to the greenish double-lights at right. So this progression isn''t giving me enough data to form meaning. I hope this helps. Keep shooting!', '2004-09-19 00:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(916194, 104542, 6870, '<td valign="top">What attracts me here are the various sculpted light patterns created by the fan (?). Outside of ''Oh, this is a fan'', I''m not sure what to think next. Perhaps a stronger point of view or mood lighting would help clarify your communication? If you are going for the abstract, then the shapes and lighting and colors have to be really special so that we can enjoy them for themselves; I don''t think that quite happens here. I hope this helps! Keep shooting!</td>', 'What attracts me here are the various sculpted light patterns created by the fan (?). Outside of ''Oh, this is a fan'', I''m not sure what to think next. Perhaps a stronger point of view or mood lighting would help clarify your communication? If you are going for the abstract, then the shapes and lighting and colors have to be really special so that we can enjoy them for themselves; I don''t think that quite happens here. I hope this helps! Keep shooting!', '2004-09-19 00:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(916196, 104421, 6870, '<td valign="top">I really like this idea. It appears as though you''ve gone to some length to create a mood with your lighting that is mysterious and perhaps even romantic. The light right on the kiss brings out the object very nicely. To improve the photo, you might consider your depth of field and experimenting with that. Also, b/w might be a good choice for this photo.</td>', 'I really like this idea. It appears as though you''ve gone to some length to create a mood with your lighting that is mysterious and perhaps even romantic. The light right on the kiss brings out the object very nicely. To improve the photo, you might consider your depth of field and experimenting with that. Also, b/w might be a good choice for this photo.', '2004-09-19 00:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(916204, 104781, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract patterns here. I''m no expert with abstract photos, but I''m having a difficult time really enjoying this image (sorry for being blunt! Yikes!). I''m not really sure what makes an abstract photo work, but the patterns or colors or shapes, it seems to me, have to be so special that they are interesting in and of themselves. This doesn''t quite do it for me, though I can appreciate your attempt. I wish I could be of more help. Sorry!</td>', 'Interesting abstract patterns here. I''m no expert with abstract photos, but I''m having a difficult time really enjoying this image (sorry for being blunt! Yikes!). I''m not really sure what makes an abstract photo work, but the patterns or colors or shapes, it seems to me, have to be so special that they are interesting in and of themselves. This doesn''t quite do it for me, though I can appreciate your attempt. I wish I could be of more help. Sorry!', '2004-09-19 00:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(916213, 104052, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is definitely mirrors! Okay, to be honest, I don''t find this shot to be very interesting. Outside of ''Oh, its a mirror/party ball", I don''t know what to think. You might try a more dramatic point of view, or different moody lighting. Or perhaps you could put the ball in its context to show how groovy it can be as a party ball. I suppose what I''m trying to get at is that this ball, in and of itself, is not an interesting subject (at least to me). It could be, though. Perhaps it could represent partying and how great it is to have friends. Or perhaps it could communicate the thrill of dancing. You have a lot of choices, and your skills as a human and as a photographer (it appears you have a particular talent for finding interesting light and tones and patterns around you) will all come into play to communicate such things. Good luck and keep shooting!</td>', 'This is definitely mirrors! Okay, to be honest, I don''t find this shot to be very interesting. Outside of ''Oh, its a mirror/party ball", I don''t know what to think. You might try a more dramatic point of view, or different moody lighting. Or perhaps you could put the ball in its context to show how groovy it can be as a party ball. I suppose what I''m trying to get at is that this ball, in and of itself, is not an interesting subject (at least to me). It could be, though. Perhaps it could represent partying and how great it is to have friends. Or perhaps it could communicate the thrill of dancing. You have a lot of choices, and your skills as a human and as a photographer (it appears you have a particular talent for finding interesting light and tones and patterns around you) will all come into play to communicate such things. Good luck and keep shooting!', '2004-09-19 00:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(916215, 104400, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is definitely mirrors! Okay, to be honest, I don''t find this shot to be very interesting. Outside of ''Oh, its a mirror/party ball", I don''t know what to think. You might try a more dramatic point of view, or different moody lighting. Or perhaps you could put the ball more in its context to show how groovy it can be as a party ball. I suppose what I''m trying to get at is that this ball, in and of itself, is not an interesting subject (at least to me). It could be, though. Perhaps it could represent partying and how great it is to have friends. Or perhaps it could communicate the thrill of dancing. You have a lot of choices, and your skills as a human and as a photographer (it appears you have a particular talent for finding interesting light and tones and patterns around you) will all come into play to communicate such things. Good luck and keep shooting!</td>', 'This is definitely mirrors! Okay, to be honest, I don''t find this shot to be very interesting. Outside of ''Oh, its a mirror/party ball", I don''t know what to think. You might try a more dramatic point of view, or different moody lighting. Or perhaps you could put the ball more in its context to show how groovy it can be as a party ball. I suppose what I''m trying to get at is that this ball, in and of itself, is not an interesting subject (at least to me). It could be, though. Perhaps it could represent partying and how great it is to have friends. Or perhaps it could communicate the thrill of dancing. You have a lot of choices, and your skills as a human and as a photographer (it appears you have a particular talent for finding interesting light and tones and patterns around you) will all come into play to communicate such things. Good luck and keep shooting!', '2004-09-19 00:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(916224, 104735, 23300, '<td valign="top">The mood of this image is very powerful. I can''t make out exactly what the details are but this doesn''t really matter. Its a very gritty dark and evocative image. Well done.</td>', 'The mood of this image is very powerful. I can''t make out exactly what the details are but this doesn''t really matter. Its a very gritty dark and evocative image. Well done.', '2004-09-19 01:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(916225, 103736, 23300, '<td valign="top">This image grows on me the more I look at it. It has a very appealling combination of textures and contrasting light. The pensive mood comes across the more I study it. The light on his right hand is a bit blown out and is a bit distracting. I wonder how this image would look in Black and White. I think Black and White would make the most of the textures and lighting.</td>', 'This image grows on me the more I look at it. It has a very appealling combination of textures and contrasting light. The pensive mood comes across the more I study it. The light on his right hand is a bit blown out and is a bit distracting. I wonder how this image would look in Black and White. I think Black and White would make the most of the textures and lighting.', '2004-09-19 01:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(916226, 104649, 23300, '<td valign="top">I like the strong rich colours and the composition. The lighting has been handled well also.</td>', 'I like the strong rich colours and the composition. The lighting has been handled well also.', '2004-09-19 01:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(916228, 104342, 23300, '<td valign="top">This is one of the most evocative images in this challenge. The composition is sublime and the balance of tones are eloquent. I also love the use of textures and the artistry of the lighting. This ones a winner for me. My only criticism is that the pose looks just a little bit "staged". I''m not sure what it is exactly, its just a feeling I get from the image. Maybe its her left arm. The overall pose looks relaxed but her left arm looks uncomfortable, like it would take some effort to hold it in that position. Good Luck with the challenge.</td>', 'This is one of the most evocative images in this challenge. The composition is sublime and the balance of tones are eloquent. I also love the use of textures and the artistry of the lighting. This ones a winner for me. My only criticism is that the pose looks just a little bit "staged". I''m not sure what it is exactly, its just a feeling I get from the image. Maybe its her left arm. The overall pose looks relaxed but her left arm looks uncomfortable, like it would take some effort to hold it in that position. Good Luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-19 01:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(916229, 105029, 23300, '<td valign="top">Nice work. Very evocative. This has a feel of "defiant youth". You have handled the lighting expertly. The large shadow is very powerful and the use of black space around the frame adds real power to his/your stare. The angle of the mirror adds to the tension in this scene also. Every element of this image enhances the look in his eyes.  Awesome work.</td>', 'Nice work. Very evocative. This has a feel of "defiant youth". You have handled the lighting expertly. The large shadow is very powerful and the use of black space around the frame adds real power to his/your stare. The angle of the mirror adds to the tension in this scene also. Every element of this image enhances the look in his eyes.  Awesome work.', '2004-09-19 01:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(916235, 104856, 23300, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and composition. I personally would have cropped it a bit tighter. The black space does add to the scene. It adds a sense of lonliness or isolation, I just think a little bit less would help to push the main subjects a little further forward. I think you have done a great job to communicate the spirit of the scene.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and composition. I personally would have cropped it a bit tighter. The black space does add to the scene. It adds a sense of lonliness or isolation, I just think a little bit less would help to push the main subjects a little further forward. I think you have done a great job to communicate the spirit of the scene.', '2004-09-19 01:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(916237, 105020, 23300, '<td valign="top">Great idea and well executed. I just wonder if the subject matter in the "glasses" really does the image justice, especially in relation to your title. I would expect something more personal or evocative to be inside the mirrors. This is a really interesting image though.</td>', 'Great idea and well executed. I just wonder if the subject matter in the "glasses" really does the image justice, especially in relation to your title. I would expect something more personal or evocative to be inside the mirrors. This is a really interesting image though.', '2004-09-19 01:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(916239, 104951, 23300, '<td valign="top">Awesome. well done. The composition, the lighting, the grain are all great. This looks like a movie poster. The focus being on the "scene" in the mirror is artisically done.</td>', 'Awesome. well done. The composition, the lighting, the grain are all great. This looks like a movie poster. The focus being on the "scene" in the mirror is artisically done.', '2004-09-19 01:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(916240, 105010, 23300, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the lighting. This is a well executed image.</td>', 'I like the composition and the lighting. This is a well executed image.', '2004-09-19 01:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(916241, 104795, 23300, '<td valign="top">Expert use of lighting. The textures are beautiful. This has been artistically executed.</td>', 'Expert use of lighting. The textures are beautiful. This has been artistically executed.', '2004-09-19 01:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(916243, 105095, 23300, '<td valign="top">Great compostion and use of lighting. The title really works for me too, especially in relation to the expression on the face. This is a really artistic approach to the topic. Well done.</td>', 'Great compostion and use of lighting. The title really works for me too, especially in relation to the expression on the face. This is a really artistic approach to the topic. Well done.', '2004-09-19 01:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(916249, 103808, 23300, '<td valign="top">Very evocative image. This really is something special. This is a shot you should be proud of. I can''t begin to express the concepts and emotions it stirs in me. Its truly inspirational. Its got all the depth and complexity of an existentialist novel. This image proves that a picture is worth a thousand words.</td>', 'Very evocative image. This really is something special. This is a shot you should be proud of. I can''t begin to express the concepts and emotions it stirs in me. Its truly inspirational. Its got all the depth and complexity of an existentialist novel. This image proves that a picture is worth a thousand words.', '2004-09-19 02:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
