(918901, 105062, 22734, '<td valign="top">I like this image. This site is not too hip on art. This is a soft effect with more sensuality had it been sharp. Keep following your ideas, they are good and you will eventually score your way !</td>', 'I like this image. This site is not too hip on art. This is a soft effect with more sensuality had it been sharp. Keep following your ideas, they are good and you will eventually score your way !', '2004-09-21 01:52:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(918914, 104163, 8891, '<td valign="top">I gave this a five....I liked the colors very much and all the lines. Great colors. There was just no big finish? Sorry...tired. But maybe if the set of small perpendicular stripes in the mirror in this filled the mirror that might have made it more interesting....well at least to me. But then I like lines, so I''ve been told. One other solution might have been a smaller change and that is replacing the brown with the green on the left and thus you would have repeated the pattern on the left totally in the mirror, and may be lessened the amount of red a bit as well. Just some ideas. Sorry for the flow......later.!</td>', 'I gave this a five....I liked the colors very much and all the lines. Great colors. There was just no big finish? Sorry...tired. But maybe if the set of small perpendicular stripes in the mirror in this filled the mirror that might have made it more interesting....well at least to me. But then I like lines, so I''ve been told. One other solution might have been a smaller change and that is replacing the brown with the green on the left and thus you would have repeated the pattern on the left totally in the mirror, and may be lessened the amount of red a bit as well. Just some ideas. Sorry for the flow......later.!', '2004-09-21 02:00:53.000000', NULL, 0),
