(921464, 104913, 22781, '<td valign="top"><b>Critique Club Comment:</b> <br/> <br/>Hi Dan,<br/> <br/>So youve been had by the Doesnt meet the Challenge clan :-)<br/>I have the same problem just in this moment with my Touch submission.<br/>True, there is no mirror present in this photo, and that was part of the challenge, but we could argue if water is or is not a mirror. Water is used as a mirror so I guess this should pass for meeting the challenge.<br/> <br/>About the photo itself, its a good photo with lots of color, and I really like how you made the reflection the eye catcher of your image, I think the glare on the left side of the car is a bit distracting and could have been avoided by using a polarizer, but then I guess the reflection in the water would have been gone, so that would not be an option.<br/>The tree branches in the reflection are also unavoidable, but also not helping.<br/>Theres not much I can tell you about this photo, I think that this is a good outcome of this subject.<br/> <br/>I think all in all this is a good picture and if the challenge would have been reflections, I think you would have scored at least top 20 with it.<br/> <br/>Keep up the good work. <br/> <br/>If you have any questions, comments or other things about this critique, or are bored and want to spam someone just PM me. <br/> <br/>Grrrtzzz <br/> <br/>Peter<br/></td>', 'Critique Club Comment:  Hi Dan, So youve been had by the Doesnt meet the Challenge clan :-)I have the same problem just in this moment with my Touch submission.True, there is no mirror present in this photo, and that was part of the challenge, but we could argue if water is or is not a mirror. Water is used as a mirror so I guess this should pass for meeting the challenge. About the photo itself, its a good photo with lots of color, and I really like how you made the reflection the eye catcher of your image, I think the glare on the left side of the car is a bit distracting and could have been avoided by using a polarizer, but then I guess the reflection in the water would have been gone, so that would not be an option.The tree branches in the reflection are also unavoidable, but also not helping.Theres not much I can tell you about this photo, I think that this is a good outcome of this subject. I think all in all this is a good picture and if the challenge would have been reflections, I think you would have scored at least top 20 with it. Keep up the good work.  If you have any questions, comments or other things about this critique, or are bored and want to spam someone just PM me.  Grrrtzzz  Peter', '2004-09-22 13:38:40.000000', NULL, 0),
