(939350, 104890, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is first rate. A great concept and cool execution. Lovely sepia tones.<br/> <br/>Images like this have a strong appeal because the mind is forever untouchable. Like a deep abyss.<br/> <br/>By adding mirrors me mimick the dual personality. This image has the feel of an old movie poster. The model did a spendid and the photographer captured the essence. Very good work.</td>', 'This is first rate. A great concept and cool execution. Lovely sepia tones. Images like this have a strong appeal because the mind is forever untouchable. Like a deep abyss. By adding mirrors me mimick the dual personality. This image has the feel of an old movie poster. The model did a spendid and the photographer captured the essence. Very good work.', '2004-10-03 22:56:43.000000', NULL, 0),
