(969584, 105037, 2553, '<td valign="top">Oddly enough, I like this.  I had to look at it for awhile, because at first glance, I didn''t think I would care for it.  It has a kind of 50''s, hand colored look that I find appealing, it also has the look of an illustration, and it''s just kind of a fun shot.  It makes you smile! At first glance I would probably have given it a 4 or 5, but after looking at would have had to bump that up to a 7 or 8.</td>', 'Oddly enough, I like this.  I had to look at it for awhile, because at first glance, I didn''t think I would care for it.  It has a kind of 50''s, hand colored look that I find appealing, it also has the look of an illustration, and it''s just kind of a fun shot.  It makes you smile! At first glance I would probably have given it a 4 or 5, but after looking at would have had to bump that up to a 7 or 8.', '2004-10-22 08:28:31.000000', NULL, 0),
