(991747, 105025, 9780, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by saintaugust:</b></div><hr/><i> i''m not 100% sure what I''m looking at.. is this the opposite side of the road reflected in the mirror and meshing perfectly with the background? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>yes :D It took 30min to level the mirror in to the right position.</td>', 'Originally posted by saintaugust: i''m not 100% sure what I''m looking at.. is this the opposite side of the road reflected in the mirror and meshing perfectly with the background?  yes :D It took 30min to level the mirror in to the right position.', '2004-11-04 14:21:43.000000', NULL, 0),
